# Author: Tigany Zarrouk (tiganyzarrouk@gmail.com)
#
# The same file asked for a local property. TurboGAP's dipole is the gradient
# of the fitted local energy at the central atom's own position, a different
# contraction of the descriptor, so there is no local property here to read.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
read_data       data/water6.data
pair_style      zero 6.0
pair_coeff      * *
compute mu all mad/property/turbogap ${dgap} dipole species O H
thermo_style    custom step c_mu
run 0
